Z||000018||Raydar||02-03-2001||09:51 PM||||Batboy, CELERY IIs will not run SMP!!!<BR>I have two C-II 600s that I was going to run in my BP6. (The vendor on Price Watch incorrectly described them as PPGA, instead of FC-PGA)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  Bought 'em before I knew better. <BR>Check out BP6.com. There is tons of info, as well as some info regarding the VP6. <BR>I'm running W2K on mine. If I had it to do over again, I'd go with NT4. W2K is a pain in the @ss, IMHO. Is also very unfriendly to Netscape, or so I've heard.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 T-top Formula<BR>88 soon-to-be-V6 coupe<p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 02-03-2001).]||||reg||1
